# A level-1 user chooses menu entries by mouse: an entry above the level
# is refused with the message that Enter gives, and an allowed entry
# opens its list.  A click on the message does nothing.
T READER
K ENTER
T Reader1986
K ENTER
C 0 3
S MITEMS
C 6 5
S DENIED
C 23 10
S ONMSG
C 0 3
C 2 5
S BYID
K ESC
S BACK
K F3
T Y
